//   unprotected ECHO of this odometer, lagging a median 214 ms (0/69 leads). This
//   DISSOLVES the ride1 "0x3C6 D4 ramp 0x61->0x71" candidate - it is just the
//   odometer low byte advancing. (0x562 itself integrates the REAR/motor-derived
//   speed: it over-counts under wheelspin and advances during stand spins - +223 m
//   logged in the 75mph stand capture with the front wheel static.)



